WEBVTT

00:12:59.236 --> 00:13:00.796
bad news travels fast.

00:13:00.836 --> 00:13:02.796
I'm surgical with my budget.

00:13:02.836 --> 00:13:04.116
I have an Excel sheet.

00:13:04.156 --> 00:13:06.196
I've got to pay all the bills.

00:13:06.196 --> 00:13:07.796
According to my Excel sheet,

00:13:07.836 --> 00:13:10.716
after I withdrew the 20 dollars
from Wells Fargo

00:13:10.756 --> 00:13:13.036
on the corner of Warm Springs and Mission,

00:13:13.076 --> 00:13:15.676
I was supposed to have 71 dollars left.

00:13:15.716 --> 00:13:17.996
I go to the ATM of Wells Fargo.

00:13:18.676 --> 00:13:21.716
I take out the 20 bucks,
I get the receipt.

00:13:21.716 --> 00:13:24.556
I look at the bottom,
instead of 71 dollars,

00:13:24.556 --> 00:13:28.636
it was 00.03.

00:13:28.956 --> 00:13:32.156
I had 20 dollars, 00.03,